'''Operation Mayhem''' was going to be a quest and a minigame found in the [[Jerry's Workshop]] event. During its existence, it remained "Closed for Maintenance", until it was replaced with the [[Glacial Cave]]. The Agents of Operation Mayhem still talk about it, though are now ice miners inside the cave. Operation Mayhem was supposed to be a snowball fight inside of the [[Snowball Fight Cave]]s.

